# field-invalid (h8-points-field): "abc" typed into P's x field, then
# Enter — the text doesn't parse, so the edit stays open in the error tone
# with the error tip. Behaviour: the URL unchanged, aria-invalid true, the
# tip "Type a number such as 1.5 - Esc puts back 2.00".
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 293 716
wait 150
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
wait 100
type "abc"
wait 100
key Enter
wait 300
shot field-invalid
